{"sections":[{"slug":"范畴的局部化","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"范畴的局部化"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的局部化</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“范畴的局部化”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一般而言</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">范畴的局部化是一种将范畴中的一些态射变得可逆的万有构造</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $(\\mathcal C,W)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/带弱等价的范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">带弱等价的范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">其局部化</span> $\\mathcal C[W^{-1}]$ <span lang=\"zh\">是满足如下万有性质的</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">与函子</span> $F\\colon \\mathcal C \\to \\mathcal D$, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $W$ <span lang=\"zh\">中所有态射变为同构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">穿过</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">同构意义下</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">唯一的函子</span> $\\mathcal C[W^{-1}] \\to \\mathcal D$. <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathcal C[W^{-1}]$ <span lang=\"zh\">也是</span> $(\\mathcal C,W)$ <span lang=\"zh\">表现的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/同伦范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}